{"meta":{"id":"springboot-multichat","category":"it/programming-languages/java/server-structure/spring-boot","title":"Spring Boot 실시간 그룹 채팅 구성","subtitle":"","summary":"Spring Boot로 실시간 그룹 채팅 구성","tags":["spring boot","java","채팅","websocket"],"color":"orange","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-orange","source":"blog: code/back/Springboot_MultChat.jsx","updatedAt":"2025-06-30(작업중)"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-orange-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-orange-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-orange-50 text-orange-700 border border-orange-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></span>SPRING BOOT</span>\r\n<span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide text-stone-400 font-serif\">2025-06-30(작업중)</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">Spring Boot 실시간 그룹 채팅 구성</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-orange-50/70 border border-orange-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-orange-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> Spring Boot로 실시간 그룹 채팅 구성</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 space-y-1.5 border-b border-stone-100\">\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">프로젝트 구성 ( https://start.spring.io/ 생성)</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">IDE : IntelliJ IDEA Community Edition 2023.3.4</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">프레임워크 : Spring Boot</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">JAVA 버전 : 21</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">빌드 툴: Apache Maven 3.8.9</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">패키징 : jar</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">사용 라이브러리</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">서버 : Spring Web</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">통신 : WebSocket</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">보안 : Spring Security ( + JWT : 토큰 )</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">메시지 브로커 : Redis</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">DB 관련 라이브러리</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">드라이버 : MySQL Driver</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">ORM :JPA</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">유효성 검사 : Validation</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">DTO 맵핑 : mapstruct</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">편의(DB) : Lombok ( + mapstruct :맵핑용 )</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">편의성 : Spring Boot DevTools</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 space-y-1.5 border-b border-stone-100\">\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 mb-1.5 text-sm sm:text-[15px] font-bold text-stone-900\">1. 기본 통신 구성</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">메시지 브로커 : Redis</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">redis (AOF 방식 사용)</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">RDB : 특정한 시점의 스냅샷으로 백업하는 방식</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">AOF : 모든 쓰기 명령에 대한 로그</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">통신 연결</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">front - back : websocket</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">back - redis : TCP/IP 연결 풀(Redis의 자체 통신 프로토콜(RESP))</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">내부 동작 순서</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">front 참여 요청 -&gt; back (브로커) -&gt; SUBSCRIBE 요청 -&gt; redis(서버 인스턴스 구독자 등록)</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">PUBLISH -&gt; redis -&gt; 등록된 SUBSCRIBE에게 메시지 -&gt; back (브로커) -&gt; front</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">front 퇴장 요청 -&gt; back (브로커) -&gt; UNSUBSCRIBE 요청 -&gt; redis(서버 인스턴스 구독자 취소)</p>\r\n<p class=\"mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-orange-700 font-semibold\">참고</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">back (브로커)가 데이터를 받으면, redis로 PUBLISH 후 DB로 저장</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 space-y-1.5 border-b border-stone-100\">\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 mb-1.5 text-sm sm:text-[15px] font-bold text-stone-900\">2. DB 구성</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">2-1. 테이블 구성 설정</p>\r\n<div class=\"my-3 border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-orange-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">테이블명</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">기능</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-orange-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">users</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">유저 정보 관리</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-orange-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">status</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">권한 관리</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-orange-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">user_sessions</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">통신 연결 관리</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-orange-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">chat_rooms</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">대화방 관리</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-orange-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">chats</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">실시간 대화 보관</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-orange-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">chats_archived</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">전날 대화 보관</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-orange-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">chats_archived_master</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">닫힌 대화방 대화 보관</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\r\n<div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-orange-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">chats , chats_archived : 대화방 존재시, 데이터 보관</span></div>\r\n<div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-orange-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">chats_archived_master : 대화방 삭제시, chats + chats_archived의 데이터 변경</span></div>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">chats관련 PK는 TSID 방식으로 겹치지 않게 구성</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">( 로드 기반의 조건부 스케줄링으로 테이블간 체팅 데이터 관리 )</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">2-2. FK 구성 설정</p>\r\n<div class=\"my-3 border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-orange-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">update : CASCADE / delete : RESTRICT</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">update : CASCADE / delete : CASCADE</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-orange-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">fk_user_status</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">fk_sessions_room</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-orange-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">fk_user_room</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">fk_sessions_user</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-orange-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">fk_chat_user</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\r\n<div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-orange-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">user_sesstions 테이블의 FK는 보관용 데이터가 아니라 update,delete 가능</span></div>\r\n<div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-orange-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">나머지 테이블은 회원이 탈퇴해도 보관할 내용이라 update만 가능</span></div>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">(회원 탈퇴 후 1년이 지나면, 개인정보 삭제 후 id 및 pswd는 더미 데이터로 변경)</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">2-3. DB 기본 구조</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">유저 관련 테이블</p>\r\n<figure class=\"my-3 flex justify-center\"><img src=\"{{ASSET}}/it/programming-languages/java/server-structure/spring-boot/assets/springboot-multichat/01.png\" alt=\"Spring Boot 실시간 그룹 채팅 구성 이미지 1\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\"></figure>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">chats 테이블</p>\r\n<figure class=\"my-3 flex justify-center\"><img src=\"{{ASSET}}/it/programming-languages/java/server-structure/spring-boot/assets/springboot-multichat/02.png\" alt=\"Spring Boot 실시간 그룹 채팅 구성 이미지 2\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\"></figure>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">기본 구성 끝</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">이제 프로그래밍 시작</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 space-y-1.5\">\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">개발하는 PC에서 도커 이미지,컨테이너 만들어서 채팅을 구현해보니 도커가 넘나 좋았다</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">그래서 기존의 라이브러리부터 DB까지 싹다 도커에 넣고 관리하고 싶어졌다</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">어차피 이렇게 된거 깃허브로 파이프라인도 잡아버리자 걍 다 자동화 가자~~</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">그러다가 입사하게 되고 내 PC작업으로 일단 두고 회사에서 코드를 짜다보니...</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">5개월이 삭제됐다</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">잊고 지내다가 다시보니</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">도커 이미지 , 컨테이너 , 깃허브 엑션 잡혀있는 것같은데 마지막 마무리를 안하고 재미있게 했으니 다음에 하자</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">라고 생각하고... 회사 코드 뜯고맛보고 즐기다가 지금이 됐다</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">시간 잡고 연동 테스트를 진행하긴 해야될건디...</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">아... 글은 또 언제 쓰지...</p>\r\n</div>\r\n","path":"it/programming-languages/java/server-structure/spring-boot/springboot-multichat","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"programming-languages","title":"프로그램 언어","path":"it/programming-languages"},{"id":"java","title":"JAVA","path":"it/programming-languages/java"},{"id":"server-structure","title":"서버 구조","path":"it/programming-languages/java/server-structure"},{"id":"spring-boot","title":"Spring Boot","path":"it/programming-languages/java/server-structure/spring-boot"}],"hasImage":false}